  "releaseNotes": "Key Improvements in v3.3.1\n\n\t\t  Improved custom header handling for request and content headers\n\t\t  Disposes transient retry responses produced by the default Polly pipeline\n\t\t  Added backward-compatible IApiClient extension helpers for ApiClient configuration methods",
